<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">You Know I'm a Hugger</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After the war against Horde Prime for the fate of Etheria, there is a lot of cleaning up to do after She-Ra released the magic. The Best Friends Squad is assembling for their next adventure. Despite the war being over some wounds still need to heal. They need some help from someone who is brave, strong, loyal, and gives great hugs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good thing Scorpia is here to breathe in a new day to the world that they live in, and help her friends through their trying times together. That first task is taking Catra on her first tour of Bright Moon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;___&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the Prologue to our series! We've tasked Scorpia with assembling and supporting the team to prepare them for the BFS adventures in *~SPACE~* following the defeat of Horde Prime. Each chapter update introduces the newest novella in the series so stay tuned here for updates!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>4theHonourofGrÃ¤yskÃ¼ll (AVAwolfpack), But_Its_For_Science (DakianDelomast), DakianDelomast</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma/Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
